{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Should one make our sister like a harlot.</b> Rashi explained: as its Targum — ית אחתנא. The explanation: because in Scripture there is אחותינו that is a plural form, Rashi needed to say: as its Targum, ית אחתנא, which is singular; for if it were plural it would be translated אחותנא."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:19.546783173Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}